00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:04.720
safe to ship something buggy and that your users won't notice.

460
00:27:04.840 --> 00:27:09.200
And I'm absolutely going to be addressing tech debt using AI.

461
00:27:09.240 --> 00:27:12.520
I'm going to be trying to improve my test coverage, make it

462
00:27:12.560 --> 00:27:15.800
make it really easy to to spot issues.

463
00:27:15.840 --> 00:27:19.800
I'm using AI to accelerate my migrations, and my refactor is

